      "content": "it's not just about a dark room. i feel like even if i close my eyes, the noise doesn't stop. it's like my brain won't turn off and everything is just... constant. i'm so tired of trying to cope with it. i just want a silence so deep that nothing can reach me anymore. like, a permanent kind of quiet.",
